        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide products and services in a number of countries outside of the United States, and our international operations accounted for approximately 7.6% of our title insurance and services segment revenues in 2025.",
